    "title": "单局玩法简介",
    "category": 4,
    "header": "单局玩法简介",
    "content": "<p style=\"text-align:center;\"></p><div class=\"media-wrap image-wrap\"><img id=\"b9f9d24b487aa74bcfc4ce176377ebce\" title=\"剧团帐篷前分发的传单.png\" alt=\"剧团帐篷前分发的传单.png\" poster=\"\" src=\"https://web.hycdn.cn/arknights/webview/resource/pic/20220624/b9f9d24b487aa74bcfc4ce176377ebce.png\"/></div><p></p><h5><span style=\"font-family:SourceHanSerifCN-Medium\"><em><span style=\"font-size:1.125em\"><span style=\"color:#ffeed7\">        尊敬的客人们：</span></span></em></span></h5><h5></h5><h5 style=\"text-align:left;\"><span style=\"font-family:SourceHanSerifCN-Medium\"><em><span style=\"font-size:1.125em\"><span style=\"color:#ffeed7\">        此处驻演的剧团叫做“猩红剧团”。</span></span></em></span></h5><h5 style=\"text-align:left;\"><span style=\"font-family:SourceHanSerifCN-Medium\"><em><span style=\"font-size:1.125em\"><span style=\"color:#ffeed7\">        历史悠久，剧目优秀。</span></span></em></span></h5><h5 style=\"text-align:left;\"><span style=\"font-family:SourceHanSerifCN-Medium\"><em><span style=\"font-size:1.125em\"><span style=\"color:#ffeed7\">        但要观看他们的演出，需要遵守些许规则。</span></span></em></span></h5><h5 style=\"text-align:left;\"><span style=\"font-family:SourceHanSerifCN-Medium\"><em><span style=\"font-size:1.125em\"><span style=\"color:#ffeed7\">        请详细阅览以下内容，以便更好地享受剧目。</span></span></em></span></h5><h5 style=\"text-align:left;\"><span style=\"font-family:SourceHanSerifCN-Medium\"><em><span style=\"font-size:1.125em\"><span style=\"color:#ffeed7\">        愿您度过一个美好的夜晚。</span></span></em></span></h5><p></p><p></p><p></p><p></p><div class=\"media-wrap image-wrap\"><img id=\"b9440d905db1fbcc92013d29264123ef\" title=\"单局玩法简介.png\" alt=\"单局玩法简介.png\" poster=\"\" src=\"https://web.hycdn.cn/arknights/webview/resource/pic/20220624/b9440d905db1fbcc92013d29264123ef.png\"/></div><p></p><p></p><p style=\"text-align:center;\"><span style=\"font-size:1.1875em\"><span style=\"color:#c6c6c6\">在</span><span style=\"color:#cd3939\">「傀影与猩红孤钻」</span><span style=\"color:#c6c6c6\">集成战略主题中，</span></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center;\"><span style=\"font-size:1.1875em\"><span style=\"color:#c6c6c6\">您将带领您的小队寻找失踪的傀影，经历一系列战斗与随机事件，</span></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center;\"><span style=\"font-size:1.1875em\"><span style=\"color:#c6c6c6\">您能抵达这幕戏剧的终章吗？又或是沉睡在历史尘埃的倒影中。<br/><br/></span></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center;\"><span style=\"font-size:1.1875em\"><span style=\"color:#c6c6c6\">无论最终是成功还是中途失败，在途中招募到的干员和获得的收藏品、货币</span></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center;\"><span style=\"font-size:1.1875em\"><span style=\"color:#c6c6c6\">都将转化成</span><span style=\"color:#ffb525\">【蜡烛】</span><span style=\"color:#c6c6c6\">与</span><span style=\"color:#ffb525\">【昏暗的灵感】</span><span style=\"color:#c6c6c6\">。<br/><br/><br/></span></span></p><div class=\"media-wrap image-wrap align-center\" style=\"text-align:center\"><img id=\"cadc476060a80a06893b4dcdb5d6c832\" title=\"image.png\" alt=\"image.png\" poster=\"\" src=\"https://web.hycdn.cn/arknights/webview/resource/pic/20220623/cadc476060a80a06893b4dcdb5d6c832.png\"/></div><p></p><p></p><div class=\"media-wrap image-wrap\"><img id=\"304\" title=\"image.png\" alt=\"image.png\" poster=\"\" src=\"https://web.hycdn.cn/arknights/webview/pic/20250605/ee6015ab4557f61b4a9b01009bc0efa8.png\"/></div><p></p><p></p><ul><li><span style=\"font-size:1.1875em\"><span style=\"color:#c6c6c6\">在</span><span style=\"color:#ffb525\">【常规行动】</span><span style=\"color:#c6c6c6\">的探索开始前，您将面临不同难度的选择，选择合适的难度或许是您成功的关键。</span></span></li></ul><p></p><p></p><p></p><p></p><p></p><div class=\"media-wrap image-wrap align-center\" style=\"text-align:center\"><img id=\"40ae686c9d61b4c0462012c0e19a45c0\" title=\"分隔栏小.png\" alt=\"分隔栏小.png\" poster=\"\" src=\"https://web.hycdn.cn/arknights/webview/resource/pic/20220627/40ae686c9d61b4c0462012c0e19a45c0.png\"/></div><p></p><p></p><div class=\"media-wrap image-wrap\"><img id=\"be9a3b99e8da71aba00bed05d50ea793\" title=\"2.png\" alt=\"2.png\" poster=\"\" src=\"https://web.hycdn.cn/arknights/webview/resource/pic/20220624/be9a3b99e8da71aba00bed05d50ea793.png\"/></div><p></p><div class=\"media-wrap image-wrap align-center\" style=\"text-align:center\"><img class=\"media-wrap image-wrap align-left\" id=\"baa650541643af2f37c59bf60da37477\" alt=\"干员的招募.png\" title=\"干员的招募.png\" src=\"https://web.hycdn.cn/arknights/is/upload/pic/20211228/baa650541643af2f37c59bf60da37477.png\"/></div><p style=\"text-align:center;\"></p><ul><li style=\"text-align:left;\"><span style=\"font-size:1.1875em\"><span style=\"color:#c6c6c6\">探险开始时，您需要选择这次的探险分队及招募组合并进行初始招募。</span></span></li></ul><p></p><p class=\"media-wrap image-wrap float-right\"></p><p></p><p class=\"media-wrap image-wrap\"></p><p style=\"text-align:left;\"></p><div class=\"media-wrap image-wrap align-center\" style=\"text-align:center\"><img id=\"40ae686c9d61b4c0462012c0e19a45c0\" title=\"分隔栏小.png\" alt=\"分隔栏小.png\" poster=\"\" src=\"https://web.hycdn.cn/arknights/webview/resource/pic/20220627/40ae686c9d61b4c0462012c0e19a45c0.png\"/></div><p></p><p></p><div class=\"media-wrap image-wrap\"><img id=\"9800ffc6c4696216da968c55ab71f903\" title=\"3.png\" alt=\"3.png\" poster=\"\" src=\"https://web.hycdn.cn/arknights/webview/resource/pic/20220624/9800ffc6c4696216da968c55ab71f903.png\"/></div><p></p><ul><li><span style=\"font-size:1.1875em\"><span style=\"color:#c6c6c6\">在探索古堡的过程中，请时刻留意您的</span><span style=\"color:#ffb525\">【目标生命值】</span><span style=\"color:#c6c6c6\">，它能决定您在探险中能走多远。</span></span></li></ul><p></p><p class=\"media-wrap image-wrap\"></p><p></p><div class=\"media-wrap image-wrap align-center\" style=\"text-align:center\"><img id=\"40ae686c9d61b4c0462012c0e19a45c0\" title=\"分隔栏小.png\" alt=\"分隔栏小.png\" poster=\"\" src=\"https://web.hycdn.cn/arknights/webview/resource/pic/20220627/40ae686c9d61b4c0462012c0e19a45c0.png\"/></div><p></p><p></p><div class=\"media-wrap image-wrap\"><img id=\"7d4552b1aa7abf7918b0a3b4e94329a5\" title=\"4.png\" alt=\"4.png\" poster=\"\" src=\"https://web.hycdn.cn/arknights/webview/resource/pic/20220624/7d4552b1aa7abf7918b0a3b4e94329a5.png\"/></div><p></p><div class=\"media-wrap image-wrap\"><img id=\"3f4f02f765c42d56d5a4f3217b5f3964\" title=\"5.png\" alt=\"5.png\" poster=\"\" src=\"https://web.hycdn.cn/arknights/webview/resource/pic/20220624/3f4f02f765c42d56d5a4f3217b5f3964.png\"/></div><p></p><div class=\"media-wrap image-wrap\"><img id=\"13cf1708798f82685b5f3572594de1b1\" title=\"6.png\" alt=\"6.png\" poster=\"\" src=\"https://web.hycdn.cn/arknights/webview/resource/pic/20220624/13cf1708798f82685b5f3572594de1b1.png\"/></div><p></p><div class=\"media-wrap image-wrap\"><img id=\"afe966741c1e1de78182ddb36b59f38d\" title=\"7.png\" alt=\"7.png\" poster=\"\" src=\"https://web.hycdn.cn/arknights/webview/resource/pic/20220624/afe966741c1e1de78182ddb36b59f38d.png\"/></div><p></p><ul><li><span style=\"font-size:1.1875em\"><span style=\"color:#c6c6c6\">无论是获得最终胜利还是在中途止步，在探索中招募到的干员、获得的物品、战斗的经历等，都会计入本次探索的分数，分数会转化为</span><span style=\"color:#ffb525\">【蜡烛】</span><span style=\"color:#c6c6c6\">，可用于提升</span><span style=\"color:#ffb525\">【古堡笔记】</span><span style=\"color:#c6c6c6\">等级获取奖励。</span></span></li><li><span style=\"font-size:1.1875em\"><span style=\"color:#c6c6c6\">在提升笔记等级的同时，还会获得</span><span style=\"color:#ffb525\">【昏暗的灵感】</span><span style=\"color:#c6c6c6\">，可用于</span><span style=\"color:#ffb525\">【幕后筹备】</span><span style=\"color:#c6c6c6\">点亮加成节点，永久提升之后的探索能力。</span></span></li><li><span style=\"font-size:1.1875em\"><span style=\"color:#c6c6c6\">需要注意的是，当</span><span style=\"color:#ffb525\">【古堡笔记】</span><span style=\"color:#c6c6c6\">等级达到当前最高等级后，您将不会继续获得</span><span style=\"color:#ffb525\">【蜡烛】</span><span style=\"color:#c6c6c6\">（初始招募和初始收藏品不计算分数）。</span></span></li></ul><p><span style=\"color:#ffffff\"><span style=\"font-size:1.125em\"><br/></span></span></p><h6 style=\"text-align:right;\"><span style=\"font-size:1.125em\"><span style=\"color:#c6c6c6\">*图片仅供参考</span></span></h6>",
